#: ../../../related.md:1 87e708544c10497bb5091aafa527f544
msgid "🔗 Related"
msgstr "🔗 相关"

#: ../../../related.md:3 770437117d524ccb87a6df45fe456031
msgid "Map making in Minecraft is a community effort. This page highlights different community projects and helps newcomers discover tools and libraries beyond Bookshelf."
msgstr "Minecraft 地图制作离不开社区的共同努力。本页面介绍不同的社区项目，并帮助新手了解 Bookshelf 之外的工具和库。"

#: ../../../related.md 8e98c0e2af874009b74c1d3d7a545a65
msgid "📂 Projects Using Bookshelf"
msgstr "📂 使用 Bookshelf 的项目"

#: ../../../related.md:8 69b8ff01ac4b46d0a236431f110c03ae
msgid "Bookshelf has a long history. It started as LGDir and was later renamed Gunivers-Lib, or Glib. This section lists projects using Bookshelf or its earlier versions."
msgstr "Bookshelf 有着悠久的历史。它最初名为 LGDir，后来改名为 Gunivers-Lib，简称 Glib。本节列出了使用 Bookshelf 或其早期版本的项目。"

#: ../../../related.md:10 532b486cabb349dc91fc660227609eeb
msgid "🌋 [Blazing Scaffolding](https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/scaffolding-rush/): a simple, fast, and intense minigame where players push enemies into lava. Only scaffoldings and concrete powders are available, so every structure is fragile…"
msgstr "🌋 [Blazing Scaffolding](https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/scaffolding-rush/)：一款简单、快速且激烈的迷你游戏，玩家需将敌人推入岩浆。游戏中仅提供脚手架和混凝土粉末，因此每个结构都脆弱不堪……"

#: ../../../related.md:12 18358b737b2346d08a10bda10392ce0f
msgid "🔥 [Creative Olympics](https://creative-olympics.org/): a week-long charity event where teams from around the world compete to create the best project, including maps, resource packs, datapacks, and builds, in a short amount of time."
msgstr "🔥 [Creative Olympics](https://creative-olympics.org/)：一项为期一周的慈善活动，来自世界各地的团队在有限时间内比拼创作，包括地图、资源包、数据包和建筑。"

#: ../../../related.md:14 a2cc90fc83724d6992b93291dd874480
msgid "⚔️ [Hierarchy](https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/1-13-x-hierarchy-a-moba-map/): inspired by MOBA-type games, Hierarchy lets players rediscover Minecraft PvP with a wide variety of skills and kits called elementals."
msgstr "⚔️ [Hierarchy](https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/1-13-x-hierarchy-a-moba-map/)：灵感来源于 MOBA 类游戏，Hierarchy 让玩家通过多种技能和被称为元素的技能包重新发现 Minecraft PvP。"

#: ../../../related.md:16 72ba0e768f8845ac8885685047902649
msgid "🟩 [Miniature blocks](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ekK0uLhAAQI) *by Sotshi*: watch how the YouTuber builds a 3D printer in this French video."
msgstr "🟩 [Miniature blocks](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ekK0uLhAAQI) *由 Sotshi 制作*：观看这位 YouTuber 如何在法语视频中搭建一台 3D 打印机。"

#: ../../../related.md:18 623b6e910f15475c9cdd96e179c6690a
msgid "🏃 [Rush Reloaded](https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/rush-reloaded-1-14/): one of the most iconic maps in Minecraft's history, which Gunivers has brought up to date. Gunivers lets you rediscover this competitive game mode whose décor is now as modern as it's colourful."
msgstr "🏃 [Rush Reloaded](https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/rush-reloaded-1-14/)：Minecraft 历史上最具标志性的地图之一，Gunivers 已将其更新至最新版本。你可以重新体验这种竞技游戏模式，以及焕然一新的现代多彩场景。"

#: ../../../related.md:20 afb3e20795cc457186a9f58ee2d5ef55
msgid "🐟 [Scuba Diving](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/scuba-diving-a-base-jump-minigame): a Minecraft mini-game map with an ocean theme. It mixes Dropper environments with various game modes, including the famous Thimble and base jump modes called **Swimming** and **Lifebuoy**."
msgstr "🐟 [Scuba Diving](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/scuba-diving-a-base-jump-minigame)：一个以海洋为主题的 Minecraft 小游戏地图。它融合了 Dropper 环境与多种游戏模式，包括著名的 Thimble 以及称为**游泳**和**救生圈**的跳跃模式。"

#: ../../../related.md:22 0c6b730f519b4b268fb00740dd5a4f8b
msgid "🏭 [Usine 4.0](https://altearn.xyz/usine-4-0/): a mini-game designed for the University of Poitiers as a teaching aid on the theme of system automation. Page in French."
msgstr "🏭 [Usine 4.0](https://altearn.xyz/usine-4-0/)：一款为普瓦捷大学设计的教学辅助小游戏，主题为系统自动化。页面为法语。"

#: ../../../related.md:24 c1c796499a1f476ab7f051880dbaabd7
msgid "🪄 [Wichery](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/witchery): a map with advanced ball physics, allowing balls to bounce on all surfaces like in One Bullet. Players trick enemies by bouncing the ball off walls and retrieving it immediately, playing solo or with one or two friends."
msgstr "🪄 [Wichery](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/witchery)：一张拥有高级球体物理效果的地图，允许球体像在《One Bullet》中一样在所有表面弹跳。玩家可以通过将球弹离墙壁并立即收回来迷惑敌人，可单人游玩或与一两位朋友一起玩。"

